  "answer_text": "Here is the contact information for **Advance Auto Parts Human Resources**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde Advance Auto Parts HR Contact Information\n\n- **HR Support Center Phone Number:** **1-800-380-4681**\n- **HR Support Center Email:** **HRSupportCenter@advance-auto.com**\n- **Corporate HR Phone Number:** **540-362-4911** \u2014 This is the primary contact number to reach the HR department for employment-related inquiries.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd50 Best Time to Call\nWhen contacting Advance Auto Parts Human Resources, make sure to call during regular business hours. The HR department is typically available from **10:00 AM to 5:00 PM, Monday through Friday**, excluding public holidays. For optimal service and shorter wait times, it is recommended to call at around **11:30 AM**, as this time tends to have less call volume.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udccb What HR Can Help You With\nCalling the Advance Auto Parts HR number can connect you with a representative who can help with matters such as **job applications, employee benefits, interview scheduling, and workplace policies.**\n\n---\n\n> \u26a0\ufe0f **Note:** Phone numbers and contact details can change. It's always a good idea to verify by visiting the official Advance Auto Parts website at **www.advanceautoparts.com**.",
